<title>USA: McGraw Hill, Fleet invest in Vertigo.</title>
<headline>McGraw Hill, Fleet invest in Vertigo.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vertigo Development Group Inc said on Thursday the McGraw Hill Capital Corp and Fleet Financial Group along with venture capitalists bought $3.75 million of its series C preferred stock in aid of financing Vertigo's interactive multimedia-based software.</p>
<p>The McGraw Hill Capital Corp is part of the McGraw Hill Cos, information services organizations serving worldwide markets. Vertigo develops and markets interactive multimedia software.</p>
</text>
